flowchart LR
    A[CSV salaries + KPI] --> B[Initialize Job]
    A --> R[Exact expected amount]
    B --> C[Create context and keys]
    C --> D[Encrypt salaries and KPI]
    D --> E[(PostgreSQL)]
    R --> E
    E --> F[SUM Job]
    F --> E
    E --> G[Multiply Job]
    G --> E
    E --> H[Verify Job uses secret key]
    H --> I[Decrypted amount + error]
    I --> E
